WEBVTT

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:12.120
Could this be…

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.750
a homemade lunch!?

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.250
Yes, it actually is one.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.000
I made as much as I could for you.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Yeah, that’s it, that’s it!

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.590
That “for you” part is the most important part!

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.430
Now, let’s eat!

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:32.670
Yum!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.510
It’s really tasty!

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:35.940
Is it?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.770
Yeah, that’s it, that’s it!

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.020
That “for you” part is the most important part!

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:44.820
Arg, I just can’t stand listening to them anymore.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:45.610
Idiot.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.190
Then don’t.
Idiot.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.020
Idiot.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:02.460
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:09.320
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:16.680
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:22.310
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.230
The sweetness

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.360
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.780
The time

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:46.330
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.220
float in the wind,

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:50.100
flowing toward you,

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:53.570
freely.

00:01:53.570 --> 00:02:00.390
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.020
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:09.020
The Result of Love and Sorrow!
A Great Shock!!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:13.030
But this does give us the opportunity

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:17.780
to eat this luxurious lunch that you made for Ryo.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.540
I’m honored to know that it pleases you.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.330
But you…

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.000
Miki-san, would you?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.000
I know it’s rude to ask you this after you treated us to lunch,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.050
but doesn’t the current
situation bother you?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.800
Meaning?

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.690
They’ve been getting along pretty well for a while now.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:37.100
Here’s some tea.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.800
Doesn’t it annoy you?
You are his fiancée.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.080
No, not really.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.220
Ryo-sama is the type of person

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.230
who will never have a second thought about something he set his mind on.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:51.130
If I intervene, he will only become more stubborn about it.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.700
You’re starting to understand
what he is like.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:02.120
Yes, we were destined to be
with one another since we were born.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:06.710
In the bottom of our hearts, our connection to one another is stronger than to anyone else.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.400
Is that so?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.720
Oh, let me get that, Akane.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.390
It’s probably for me.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.640
Yes, hello?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.270
Hey, Ojo, it’s me.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.470
Brother and Emiho-san, huh?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.510
I asked him to adjust my shift.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:17.890
You’re right.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.660
Yeah, I guess it’s going okay.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:28.330
I don… ow many…, you know.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.810
So, see you at 9:30.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.840
If you’re late, I’ll fine you.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:33.950
Yes, Ojo-sama.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.990
Rendezvous point: K-76.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.660
Time: 0930.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.620
Destination: Tokyo-07.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.330
Location: The zoo.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.350
The weather…

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.840
Oh?

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.920
Oh my, that’s not good!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.480
That’s one long nose.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.610
Um, I mean, neck.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.130
Yeah.

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:18.130
Where are the females?

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.750
I solved at least one mystery.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.730
I’ve been wondering about it for a while.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:46.690
Why do lovers call each other after dates even though they spent the entire day together?

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:47.980
And?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:52.110
I think I understand
their feelings a bit more.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.860
Will you call me again tonight?

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:56.110
If I feel like it.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:03.860
Actually, I probably will.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.710
Why did this happen all of a sudden?!

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.050
It didn’t look like…

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:25.260
Did I put an umbrella in my bag?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.980
Oh, man.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:42.410
The date would have been ruined
if it had started raining any earlier.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:45.790
I’m glad that it didn’t
start during your date.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.040
Thanks.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.870
So, how was the zoo?

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:56.140
Surprisingly, we saw many animals.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.170
Wow!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:02.260
But isn’t that what the zoo is for!

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.150
Jeez, Ryo-sama!

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.560
Sorry.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.660
Huh? Did I tell her where I was going?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.150
Lightning is rare this time of year.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.740
That was pretty close.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.500
I wonder how Akane and Ojo are doing?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.350
Don’t worry.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.700
Akane-san called

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:31.560
and Emiho-sama got in a car just a moment ago.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.080
Okay.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.760
That’s good.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.150
She just arrived at her home.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.130
Wait a sec.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.590
What are you talking about?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.340
What, what?

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:48.850
You were worried about Emiho-sama, so…

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:51.640
So how do you know all that?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.850
Oh, it’s easy!

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:56.990
I link up to the cutting edge, VIP security system

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:01.290
and then analyze the data using the super computer.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:06.200
We are monitoring your safety without intruding on your privacy.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.000
What?!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.010
Out of my way!

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:19.590
Owie!

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:23.480
That was so mean, Ryo-sama!

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:40.230
How long?

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.500
How long have you been acting so thoughtlessly?!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.950
How long?

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:51.620
It’s not anything new.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:56.930
Emiho-sama is a very important person to you.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:58.670
As your fiancée,

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:03.510
it’s only natural that I look out for your friends.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.760
Um, Ryo-sama?

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.970
Oh, if it’s about the umbrella I snuck in,

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:16.520
I couldn’t tell when you were coming home, so…

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:19.900
I should have put one in
for Emiho-sama too.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.460
I’m sorry.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.670
No!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.530
No, no!

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:25.990
That’s not it at all!

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:29.200
Don’t you have anything else to say after all of this?!

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.920
Apologize! Apologize!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.090
Sure…

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.860
I’m sorry.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:36.830
But it’s no good to help after an accident happens.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.430
It’s better to prevent them.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:44.810
I was just trying my best to do that.

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:51.910
I’m home.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:52.760
For me?!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:54.930
A wife’s duty?!

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.100
When did I ask you to do this?!

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:00.520
It’s none of your business what I do or where I do it!

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.830
Absolutely none!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:05.820
Brother…

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:11.370
It’s one thing to invade my privacy.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.800
But you invaded Ojo’s as well.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:45.430
He didn’t say why he went on ahead.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.780
I’m sorry for all the commotion.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.570
But it’s just a minor quarrel,
so don’t worry about it.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.630
Cheer up.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.580
Yeah, you’re right.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.060
That’s enough.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:11.100
I understand now.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.020
Hey, Ryo,

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.730
What?

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:28.780
Did you watch TV yesterday?

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.490
What?

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.580
Hey, don’t you…

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.340
What?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.340
Well, nothing…

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:45.650
Since that day, my brother has been completely ignoring Shizuka-chan.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:50.360
Yes, it’s as if Shizuka-chan
didn’t exist at all.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.800
This is so cruel!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:56.180
Ryo-sama, you’re so cold!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.430
I have been dumped by my dearest!!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:01.870
What will happen to this tragic heroine?

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:02.950
To be continued
To be continued…

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.280
To be continued

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.860
The moment came

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.860
very much out of the blue.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:18.000
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.720
then started to change everything.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.550
If my meeting you

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:28.400
is not by fate,

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:33.760
there are no miracles,

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:38.950
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:42.340
Embracing love,

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.270
kissing love,

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:50.200
holding love,

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.540
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.530
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:01.950
forever.
